  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the copper pot over medium heat",
    "Add the smoked paprika and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly",
    "Add the garlic and onion and cook until the onion is translucent",
    "Add the tuna steaks and cook for 2 minutes on each side",
    "Add the port wine and bring to a boil",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes",
    "Add the cherry tomatoes and cook for an additional 2 minutes",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley and season with salt and black pepper to taste",
    "Finish the dish with a flambe, igniting the port wine and cooking for 30 seconds",
    "Serve the tuna steaks with the smoky sauce spooned over the top"
